Subject: Summary: daemon.log errors
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96079334819083

Thanks for the help!

Marco Luchini explained:

SIA is the security integration architecture - ie the layer that does things
like  checking passwords.

What the error means is that rexec called the SIA layer and it failed to
start ie somebody typed the wrong username/passwd combination when trying to
log in via rexec.  The call to rexec is typically used by client/server
applications or things like eXceed.  Basically anything which doesn't get a
regular login prompt.

Thanks again!
Mary

