I found my answer just after I posted the message.

The problem was that I forgot that the httpd server only listens.  It 
looks like that a user had connected to the server on port 80 during 
httpd start up - why I don't know.

I did a netstat -a and spotted the culprit and a swift kick in the 
wotsits cured the problem.

Simon

