	I used SWCC to shutdown my HSZ22 controller and I added a second
shelf. 
	I've got everything cabled as before, with the exception of the
second 
	shelf cabled in. 

	Now I can see the HSZ22, but no devices on it. 
	ARC shows SCSI2 isp1 but no devices. 

	I can't reload the config from floppy - it gives me an error. 
	DU never sees any devices on SCSI 2. 

	Any ideas ? 
