From tru64-unix-managers  Wed Jan 12 08:35:15 2000
From: Jonathan Nicholson <jjn () sanger ! ac ! uk>
Date: Wed, 12 Jan 2000 08:35:15 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: [Summary] Problems mounting CDRs
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96079271218495


This turns out not to be a Tru64 problem. There was a bug in the version
of cdrecord we were using that stops 64 bit machines being able to read
the cds produced.

To be able to use CDs on 64bit machines you need cdrecord version 1.8pre30
or higher. (The one shipped with RedHat 6.1 is 1.8pre29 - d'oh)

Thanks to everyone who replied!

