> the systems I have upgraded originally had the factory installed software,
> which did include AdvFS, LSM, ATM etc. I usually delete these subsets, as
> most of the systems I have updated have no requirement for them and they
are
> just taking up valuable disk space. But always on the step up to V4.0F
AdvFS
> and LSM are put back.
> 
> Can anyone explain this behavior ?
> 
> Regards
> 
