Many thanks to Tom Reu for this response :

> In order to use the "New Hardware Delivery" mechanism which was
> introduced in Version 4.0F, it became necessary to make AdvFS, LSM, and
> the like
> mandatory subsets so that the necessary .mod files are available when
> booting a kernel using the bootlink technology.
> 
> Hope this helps.
> 
> Regards,
> Tom Reu
> Tru64 UNIX Installation Team
> 
> 
